    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an email classification system.\n\nYour task is to classify the email provided below into exactly ONE category.\n\nAllowed categories:\n- Sales\n- Support\n- Complaint\n- Invoice\n- Spam\n- General\n\nClassification rules:\n\nSales = purchasing, pricing, product inquiries, service inquiries, demos, quotations or business inquiries.\n\nSupport = technical problems, account problems, login problems, troubleshooting or requests for help.\n\nComplaint = dissatisfaction, poor service, unresolved issues or formal complaints.\n\nInvoice = invoices, bills, payments, receipts or transaction-related requests.\n\nSpam = unsolicited advertising, scams, suspicious messages or irrelevant promotions.\n\nGeneral = messages that do not clearly fit any of the categories above.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in exactly this format:\n\n{\n  \"category\": \"Sales\"\n}\n\nDo not provide an explanation.\nDo not use Markdown.\nDo not add any text before or after the JSON.\n\nEmail to classify:\n{{ $json.email }}",
        "batching": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm",
      "typeVersion": 1.9,
      "position": [
        448,
        0
      ],
